WEBVTT

00:30.190 --> 00:32.189
There's a goddess in front of me.

00:39.020 --> 00:42.570
A goddess lying peacefully,
just like the Buddha.

00:42.570 --> 00:46.520
Because she is such a revered being,
it was natural that I show her respect.

00:55.790 --> 00:57.730
A waist lacking curves.

00:57.730 --> 01:00.660
A physique that makes you wonder
if she's a young girl.

01:00.660 --> 01:04.280
Could that be her third eye
that I saw on her chest?

01:05.840 --> 01:07.450
So cold.

01:09.910 --> 01:11.890
We've both been through a lot,

01:11.890 --> 01:15.560
but I'm happy that
we've managed to get married.

01:15.560 --> 01:18.270
Oh, right. We don't have
much time in the morning.

01:18.270 --> 01:19.490
Better get her up.

01:20.030 --> 01:22.850
Roxy, wake up.
It's already morning.

01:27.730 --> 01:29.930
Good morning.

01:31.280 --> 01:33.990
Good morning...

01:35.030 --> 01:38.540
Why are you looking so dejected?

01:38.540 --> 01:39.850
It's nothing.

01:39.850 --> 01:44.380
I just wanted to take a nice look at
your body in the daylight, Master.

01:46.110 --> 01:50.720
Good grief, we've got to get ready.
I'm sure everyone is already up now.

01:53.100 --> 01:54.180
Yes.

02:02.050 --> 02:03.520
Good morning, Sylphie.

02:03.970 --> 02:05.570
Good morning, Rudy.

02:06.930 --> 02:09.110
Lucy is full of energy again today.

02:09.110 --> 02:11.330
Good morning, Lucy.

02:11.330 --> 02:13.820
Despite my concerns,

02:13.820 --> 02:16.610
Lucy has been growing steadily.

02:16.610 --> 02:20.290
Sylphie's postpartum period has gone well,
both mother and baby are healthy.

02:20.290 --> 02:22.750
Our daughter is as adorable as ever.

02:22.750 --> 02:24.230
No kidding.

02:24.230 --> 02:26.730
Why is she so cute, anyway?

02:26.730 --> 02:28.880
She probably takes after her mom.

02:29.320 --> 02:32.380
Good grief.
Thank you, Rudy.

02:35.770 --> 02:37.490
Good morning, Roxy.

02:39.510 --> 02:41.520
Good morning.

02:42.210 --> 02:46.210
Roxy, how was Rudy last night?

02:46.210 --> 02:50.110
W-Well, we've done a lot of rounds.

02:50.110 --> 02:52.090
He was very gentle.

02:52.090 --> 02:54.030
Sorry, I shouldn't be saying this.

02:54.030 --> 02:56.130
You don't have to apologize.

02:56.130 --> 02:57.580
Is that so?

02:57.580 --> 02:58.870
Yes.

03:01.970 --> 03:03.500
Good morning, Norn.

03:03.500 --> 03:05.460
Good morning, Brother.

03:05.460 --> 03:09.370
I've finished writing Ruijerd's story.

03:09.370 --> 03:11.150
Would you mind checking it?

03:11.150 --> 03:12.460
Of course.

03:13.010 --> 03:17.680
I did write a book in order to restore
the Superd's reputation,

03:17.680 --> 03:20.100
but now, Norn is writing most of it.

03:20.100 --> 03:23.680
Her writing is still clumsy,
but she's working hard on it.

03:23.680 --> 03:27.440
I think she could make it more
interesting than when I did.

03:27.440 --> 03:29.560
I'm looking forward to reading it.

03:33.640 --> 03:35.440
Good morning, Mom.

03:36.460 --> 03:39.050
Mom, it's Brother.

03:45.200 --> 03:49.130
Several months after
coming back to Sharia,

03:49.130 --> 03:51.590
Zenith's memory
hasn't returned to her.

03:51.590 --> 03:54.170
There have been some small changes.

03:54.170 --> 03:56.850
But for now, we need to
keep looking after her.

03:58.090 --> 04:01.050
Breakfast! Breakfast!

04:01.050 --> 04:04.210
It's time for breakfast!

04:06.040 --> 04:09.100
Good morning,
Big Brother and his wives!

04:09.100 --> 04:10.720
Good morning, Aisha.

04:10.720 --> 04:12.860
What's for today's breakfast?

04:12.860 --> 04:16.620
Today's pretty much
the same as always.

04:16.620 --> 04:17.950
Aisha.

04:17.950 --> 04:22.430
Tell properly what you're serving.

04:22.430 --> 04:25.370
We have a sweet potato and Yoko
bean soup, served with white bread.

04:25.370 --> 04:28.210
And highly nutritious horse milk.

04:28.210 --> 04:33.410
Master Rudeus, Madam Sylphiette,
Madam Roxy, good morning.

04:33.410 --> 04:35.460
Good morning, Lilia.

04:35.820 --> 04:37.440
- Aisha and Lilia continue to take care
- Aisha,

04:37.440 --> 04:38.690
- Aisha and Lilia continue to take care
- bring the food over before they gets cold.

04:38.690 --> 04:39.990
- of the household, just as they always have.
- bring the food over before they gets cold.

04:39.990 --> 04:41.430
- of the household, just as they always have.
- Okay!

04:41.430 --> 04:43.350
- Aisha is often scolded for getting too excited,
- Breakfast!

04:43.350 --> 04:45.340
- Aisha is often scolded for getting too excited,
- Aisha, behave yourself!

04:45.340 --> 04:46.020
- but they both seem happy.
- Aisha, behave yourself!

04:46.020 --> 04:47.680
- but they both seem happy.
- Breakfast!

04:48.520 --> 04:50.940
We were separated for a long time,

04:50.940 --> 04:54.190
but now we can be together
again as a family.

04:54.680 --> 04:57.760
That's enough to make me
happy right now.

04:57.760 --> 05:00.330
Okay, everyone.
Let's eat!

05:13.830 --> 05:17.980
Sylphie and I are going to
school again today.

05:17.980 --> 05:20.340
And it's not just us.

05:22.070 --> 05:23.760
What is it?

05:23.760 --> 05:25.710
No, it's nothing.

05:25.710 --> 05:26.920
Is that so?

05:26.920 --> 05:31.370
Have you already introduced Roxy
to everyone at school?

05:31.370 --> 05:32.440
Yeah.

05:32.440 --> 05:36.770
When I recommended Master Roxy
as a professor at the University,

05:36.770 --> 05:40.530
I gave her a tour and made sure to tell
everyone how wonderful she is.

05:40.530 --> 05:43.090
"My master is such a great person."

05:43.090 --> 05:48.370
So learning just how great she is can
only be a positive thing for everyone.

05:49.470 --> 05:51.040
It's just like you, Rudy.

05:52.890 --> 05:56.720
I'm happy to get introduced
to many people.

05:56.720 --> 06:00.140
But, Rudy, you only introduced me
as your master,

06:00.140 --> 06:02.510
not as your wife.

06:04.070 --> 06:05.390
Rudy?

06:05.390 --> 06:07.850
I'm so sorry, Roxy!

06:07.850 --> 06:12.940
Ah, my sweetheart, you know
how much I love you, right?

06:14.110 --> 06:16.690
T-Thank you.

06:16.690 --> 06:20.460
Hey, Rudy.
What about me?

06:20.460 --> 06:23.150
Of course, I love you too, Sylphie.

06:23.150 --> 06:24.530
I love...

06:26.160 --> 06:28.200
both of you!

06:29.910 --> 06:31.070
- W-Wait...
- Way to go, Quagmire!

06:31.070 --> 06:31.580
- Rudy?!
- Way to go, Quagmire!

06:31.580 --> 06:32.250
- Rudy?!
- As expected of the Boss!

06:32.250 --> 06:33.390
- Let's not do this in school, okay?
- As expected of the Boss!

06:33.390 --> 06:34.380
- Let's not do this in school, okay?
- I'm jealous, damn it!

06:34.380 --> 06:35.650
- I agree.
- I'm jealous, damn it!

06:35.650 --> 06:38.630
Brother, that's embarrassing.

06:43.190 --> 06:45.840
Well then, I'll be heading this way.

06:45.840 --> 06:48.350
Yeah, do your best with your studies.

06:48.350 --> 06:49.450
Yes.

06:51.140 --> 06:54.350
Brother, I'll be going home again today.

06:58.770 --> 06:59.830
Good morning!

06:59.830 --> 07:01.040
You're late!

07:01.040 --> 07:02.070
Good morning.

07:02.070 --> 07:03.610
Good morning, Norn.

07:03.610 --> 07:06.300
Norn is popular, isn't she?

07:06.300 --> 07:08.280
Norn is cute, after all.

07:08.280 --> 07:11.300
Everyone can tell
how hard she's working.

07:11.300 --> 07:13.320
It makes them want to cheer her on.

07:13.320 --> 07:16.500
As her older brother,
I'm happy that my sister is popular.

07:16.500 --> 07:21.250
Though if any of those males lay
a hand on Norn, they'll pay dearly.

07:21.250 --> 07:23.490
- I'm not going to let some total stranger
- Let's go shopping in the town next time.

07:23.490 --> 07:25.970
- take my little sister.
- Hey, she's going with us!

07:25.970 --> 07:29.550
- Right, Dad?
- Then, let's go together.

07:35.270 --> 07:36.470
You can enter.

07:37.290 --> 07:38.810
Excuse me.

07:41.240 --> 07:43.550
E- Excuse me.

07:44.190 --> 07:46.170
I've been waiting for you.

07:47.330 --> 07:50.450
Rudeus resumed school today, correct?

07:50.450 --> 07:55.450
Yes, I just said hello the other day.
I'll be in your care again starting today.

07:55.450 --> 07:58.440
I look forward to having
you back as well.

07:59.370 --> 08:03.550
Roxy, you're going to stand at the front
of the classroom starting today.

08:03.550 --> 08:05.050
Are you nervous?

08:05.050 --> 08:06.470
Yes...

08:08.290 --> 08:09.300
Master.

08:10.890 --> 08:14.570
Roxy, who used to say
she didn't need a master,

08:14.570 --> 08:16.560
sure has changed a lot, huh?

08:16.560 --> 08:19.770
Yes, I'm surprised myself.

08:19.770 --> 08:22.500
The young me was really arrogant.

08:22.500 --> 08:28.450
But now, I've learned a bit about
the joy of teaching people.

08:30.810 --> 08:34.080
I'm looking forward to working
with you, Professor Roxy.

08:34.539 --> 08:35.549
Yes, sir!

08:37.440 --> 08:40.330
Well then, I'll be heading
to the classroom.

08:40.330 --> 08:42.710
Yes, see you later.

08:45.790 --> 08:47.530
Good morning.

08:48.220 --> 08:50.630
What? I'm the first?

08:50.630 --> 08:52.180
Ah, Boss!

08:52.840 --> 08:54.830
Meowrning!

08:54.830 --> 08:56.270
Morning.

08:56.270 --> 08:58.160
Good morning, both of you.

08:58.160 --> 09:00.520
Boss, I saw you earlier.

09:00.520 --> 09:03.190
Flirting with two females
early in the meowrning.

09:03.190 --> 09:04.550
Aren't you a lucky guy?

09:04.550 --> 09:08.760
You're dumping us and then picking up
a second wife, what a nuhni.

09:08.760 --> 09:12.470
We're graduating this year,
let's get a man for ourselves too.

09:12.470 --> 09:15.410
Yeah, we're definitely going
to get one this year.

09:15.410 --> 09:18.090
Find a man,
and then return to our home.

09:18.090 --> 09:20.520
I hope we can find a good one.

09:20.520 --> 09:24.010
Until now, they have always treated
such things as a hassle,

09:24.010 --> 09:28.010
but it seems they've gotten jealous
of me having flowers in both hands.

09:28.010 --> 09:29.170
Master!

09:29.170 --> 09:31.520
If it isn't my master!

09:31.520 --> 09:32.890
Good morning.

09:32.890 --> 09:35.680
Good morning, Grand Master.

09:35.680 --> 09:37.580
Good morning, Zanoba.

09:37.580 --> 09:39.170
You too, Julie.

09:39.170 --> 09:42.420
If you are in the classroom,
then I can assume that...

09:42.420 --> 09:45.120
Yeah, we can research together again.

09:45.120 --> 09:47.100
Well then, that's perfect.

09:47.100 --> 09:49.890
There's something I'd like you
to look at later.

09:49.890 --> 09:51.560
What is it?

09:53.660 --> 09:56.870
The result of the research
of the past six months!

09:58.250 --> 10:01.750
I understand.
I'm looking forward to seeing it.

10:09.980 --> 10:11.210
Good morning.

10:11.810 --> 10:13.170
Morning.

10:14.310 --> 10:15.470
Are you okay?

10:16.030 --> 10:17.600
I'm fine.

10:17.600 --> 10:22.660
Since you're here, it means that you
won't go anywhere for a while, right?

10:22.660 --> 10:23.730
Yeah.

10:24.320 --> 10:25.340
I see.

10:25.890 --> 10:28.600
Now we can get the research
back on track.

10:29.170 --> 10:30.480
Rudeus!

10:30.480 --> 10:33.350
Good morning, Senior Cliff.

10:33.350 --> 10:36.470
I heard that you returned
together with Lise,

10:36.470 --> 10:40.070
but why didn't you stop by
to say hello to me?

10:40.070 --> 10:43.870
Sorry about that.
I did stop by your place, but...

10:43.870 --> 10:47.120
It seemed you and Elinalise were busy.

10:48.050 --> 10:52.020
I... I see...
I suppose that couldn't be helped.

10:52.020 --> 10:53.800
I guess I'm also at fault.

10:54.260 --> 10:59.210
However, you could at least have
called me when your child was born.

10:59.210 --> 11:01.180
Y-Yeah, I guess you're right.

11:01.180 --> 11:03.700
I'm sure you're busy
raising your child,

11:03.700 --> 11:06.940
but it seems like you have
been avoiding me lately.

11:06.940 --> 11:09.370
There was a reason for that.

11:09.370 --> 11:15.950
Since he's a member of the Millis Church,
he won't like that I got a second wife.

11:15.950 --> 11:20.100
Is there some reason
you didn't want to see me?

11:24.160 --> 11:26.770
- Actually, I got...
- Good morning.

11:27.620 --> 11:30.290
Everyone, please return to your seats.

11:31.460 --> 11:34.130
I'm Roxy Migurdia Greyrat.

11:34.130 --> 11:36.120
Starting today,

11:36.120 --> 11:39.470
she will be appointed as a professor
at the Ranoa University of Magic.

11:39.470 --> 11:42.280
I'll be assisting her for a while.

11:42.280 --> 11:45.850
Since she will be this class's
homeroom teacher,

11:45.850 --> 11:48.650
I hope you'll all treat her well.

11:49.330 --> 11:52.550
I'm sure many of you have
already been introduced to me.

11:52.550 --> 11:57.250
I'm also the second wife
of Rudeus Greyrat over there.

11:57.250 --> 12:01.120
Though as teacher and student,
our interactions will be different.

12:01.120 --> 12:03.430
I look forward to being with you all.

12:03.430 --> 12:05.250
So...

12:05.250 --> 12:08.510
Your second wife, huh?

12:21.030 --> 12:24.970
Is the word faithful not part
of your vocabulary, Rudeus?

12:24.970 --> 12:29.810
I know that I'm lacking in that part.

12:31.230 --> 12:36.860
I blessed your marriage to Sylphie because
you told me you'd love her, and just her.

12:36.860 --> 12:41.820
Yes, and I'm very grateful to you.

12:41.820 --> 12:48.170
I knew that you don't share my religion,
so I won't say anything more.

12:48.170 --> 12:50.810
If anything, I give you my blessing.

12:52.220 --> 12:53.890
Congratulations.

12:53.890 --> 12:55.970
Thank you very much.

13:00.860 --> 13:04.560
I've been meeting your little sister
in the town church many times.

13:05.970 --> 13:13.750
She told me that she hoped to have a happy
marriage like you and Sylphie someday.

13:14.450 --> 13:18.860
Did she say anything to you
when you brought your second wife home?

13:20.620 --> 13:22.320
She was very angry.

13:22.320 --> 13:24.030
That's to be expected!

13:24.030 --> 13:28.250
She'd been praying almost every day
for you and your father's safe return.

13:28.250 --> 13:33.380
Your homecoming should have
been a happy occasion for her.

13:33.380 --> 13:38.870
But, after losing her father,
you're the only one she can depend on now.

13:38.870 --> 13:42.620
I think you need to be more
considerate of her feelings.

13:43.250 --> 13:44.390
Yes.

13:45.050 --> 13:49.130
Having too many partners
isn't a good thing.

13:49.130 --> 13:51.080
Yes.

13:51.080 --> 13:53.010
Um, Senior Cliff?

13:53.010 --> 13:54.900
What is it, Rudeus?

13:54.900 --> 13:57.910
You were keeping an eye on Norn,
weren't you?

13:57.910 --> 13:59.280
Thank you so much.

14:00.600 --> 14:04.390
We go to the same church,
and we talked a bit. That's all.

14:05.280 --> 14:09.370
Also, don't let a girl that young
wander around by herself.

14:09.370 --> 14:11.630
Even though this area is safe,

14:11.630 --> 14:14.650
I've heard of kidnappers
lurking in the back alleys.

14:14.650 --> 14:17.130
You're right.
I'll take that advice seriously.

14:17.130 --> 14:19.060
You sure?
I mean, you are...

14:19.060 --> 14:22.360
Come on, isn't that enough?

14:22.360 --> 14:25.320
Master has returned safely.
That's enough to be grateful for.

14:26.430 --> 14:29.790
Very well.
He seems to be reflecting on it.

14:29.790 --> 14:32.140
I'll forgive you for your sin.

14:32.140 --> 14:35.560
Saint Millis taught us
to be lenient, after all.

14:35.560 --> 14:37.450
Thank you very much.

14:41.840 --> 14:43.790
I've heard about it from Lise,

14:43.790 --> 14:46.930
but what opponent could be strong
enough to make you lose a hand?

14:48.270 --> 14:50.490
It was a hydra that was
immune to magic.

14:50.490 --> 14:52.780
Immune to magic...

14:52.780 --> 14:55.360
I can see why you struggled against it.

14:55.360 --> 14:57.380
It's amazing that you were able to defeat it.

14:57.380 --> 14:59.790
It was thanks to my father and others.

15:00.430 --> 15:04.880
We did win,
but it came at a heavy price.

15:08.560 --> 15:11.530
Master, on that note,
please wait a bit.

15:15.460 --> 15:17.480
Please look at this.

15:17.480 --> 15:19.190
What is that?

15:19.190 --> 15:21.740
The one that I mentioned earlier
in the classroom.

15:21.740 --> 15:23.750
The fruit of our research.

15:23.750 --> 15:25.830
Now, can I have your left hand?

15:25.830 --> 15:26.990
S-Sure.

15:34.290 --> 15:36.060
It's about to fall, though?

15:36.060 --> 15:39.650
The incantation is:
"Earth, be thou my hand."

15:39.650 --> 15:40.520
Yes?

15:40.520 --> 15:43.050
Please try it!

15:44.190 --> 15:47.240
Earth, be thou my hand.

15:58.180 --> 16:00.470
It's moving... It's moving!

16:00.470 --> 16:02.110
Here, try it, Rudeus.

16:05.360 --> 16:08.840
This is amazing! I could even feel
all the way through the fingertips!

16:08.840 --> 16:09.990
What is this?

16:09.990 --> 16:13.740
A magical implement in the shape of a hand
that moves according to its bearer's will!

16:13.740 --> 16:19.620
I managed to make it by analyzing
the automaton doll with Cliff's help.

16:19.620 --> 16:24.750
By using this, I'm able to control
my strength when I make a doll!

16:24.750 --> 16:26.560
That's amazing!

16:26.560 --> 16:30.510
If you want to increase its strength,
simply feed it more of your mana.

16:30.990 --> 16:32.260
Really?

16:36.260 --> 16:38.860
You are holding a grudge
about earlier, aren't you?

16:38.860 --> 16:42.610
I wasn't sure if we could use it
without a hand,

16:42.610 --> 16:44.460
but it seems there are no problems.

16:44.460 --> 16:48.280
Hey, there won't be any problem
if I use magic with this?

16:49.200 --> 16:51.620
It's about time you let go of my hand!

16:51.620 --> 16:54.160
- Let's test it, then!
- Don't squeeze my hand any harder!

16:59.620 --> 17:00.940
What is that?

17:00.940 --> 17:02.510
Another duel?

17:02.510 --> 17:03.130
Huh?!

17:07.690 --> 17:10.160
It's ready!

17:10.160 --> 17:12.079
All right, let's try it.

17:12.079 --> 17:12.950
Yes.

17:12.950 --> 17:14.650
Here I go!

17:44.000 --> 17:47.520
It seems there's no problem with
using magic while wearing it.

17:47.520 --> 17:48.670
Yes.

17:50.260 --> 17:52.750
As expected of Master!
Well done!

17:52.750 --> 17:56.220
This is an amazing invention.
To be honest, I'm really in awe.

17:56.220 --> 17:57.890
Thank you very much.

17:57.890 --> 18:01.180
If you don't mind,
I want you to keep it with you.

18:01.180 --> 18:01.940
Huh?

18:01.940 --> 18:02.990
Are you sure?

18:02.990 --> 18:04.030
Yes.

18:04.030 --> 18:07.500
That's still a prototype,
but I'm sure it's better than nothing.

18:07.500 --> 18:14.110
And with you and Cliff, I'm sure I can
make another one in no time.

18:14.110 --> 18:18.200
By the way, do you have a name
for this magical implement?

18:18.200 --> 18:21.390
Oh, it doesn't have a name yet.

18:21.390 --> 18:26.520
Cliff and I don't have much talent
for naming things.

18:26.520 --> 18:29.690
Since we're at it,
why don't you give it a name?

18:29.690 --> 18:32.510
Good idea!
Please give it a name!

18:40.270 --> 18:43.290
Then, taking a bit from
both of your names,

18:43.290 --> 18:45.270
let's call it Zaliff Prosthetic Hand.

18:45.790 --> 18:48.130
Shouldn't your name
be in there as well?

18:48.130 --> 18:51.170
That's okay. I didn't really
contribute to making this.

18:51.170 --> 18:55.280
I think you shouldn't have
to humble yourself.

18:58.600 --> 19:00.660
Very well.

19:00.660 --> 19:05.010
Let us call it Zaliff Prosthetic Hand,
Prototype One.

19:23.730 --> 19:27.880
Welcome home, Big Brother!

19:30.960 --> 19:35.650
Would you like dinner? A bath?
Or maybe...

19:35.650 --> 19:39.070
Me? My-self?

19:40.210 --> 19:44.330
Then, I would like to have you!

19:44.330 --> 19:46.310
Take this!

19:46.310 --> 19:48.860
Big Brother is hitting on me!

19:48.860 --> 19:49.930
Huh?

19:54.210 --> 19:55.440
I'm home.

20:00.720 --> 20:03.580
Is that prosthetic hand
a magical implement?

20:03.580 --> 20:07.480
Yes, this is the result of Zanoba
and Senior Cliff's research.

20:07.480 --> 20:11.270
That's amazing.
It's moving like a real hand.

20:11.270 --> 20:15.450
With this, I will be able to
manage my daily life just fine.

20:15.450 --> 20:20.200
Plus, this way I can enjoy
both of you to the fullest!

20:20.200 --> 20:22.030
Good grief, Rudy...

20:22.030 --> 20:24.190
Hey!
Where are you touching?

20:24.190 --> 20:26.830
Brother, that's embarrassing.

20:26.830 --> 20:30.170
Dinner! Dinner!

20:30.170 --> 20:33.170
It's time for dinner!

20:34.320 --> 20:37.910
Today's pretty much the same as always.

20:37.910 --> 20:39.220
Aisha!

20:39.220 --> 20:40.760
Okay.

20:41.430 --> 20:43.390
Let's eat!

20:43.990 --> 20:49.020
A lot has happened since
the Fittoa Teleportation Incident.

20:49.580 --> 20:51.550
The journey on the Demon Continent.

20:51.550 --> 20:53.530
Parting with Eris.

20:53.530 --> 20:55.410
Healing my sickness.

20:55.410 --> 20:57.370
Marrying Sylphie.

20:57.370 --> 20:59.410
Reunion with Roxy.

20:59.410 --> 21:01.030
Rescuing my mom.

21:01.770 --> 21:05.470
Although we lost some along the way,

21:05.470 --> 21:08.410
we have now returned to
our normal daily life.

21:08.900 --> 21:12.750
I'm going to protect this normal
daily life of ours from now on.

21:48.430 --> 21:51.460
After I regained my peaceful daily life...

21:56.410 --> 22:00.130
Today, too, I prayed earnestly like this.

22:02.010 --> 22:05.010
EPISODE 3
A RETURN TO NORMAL LIFE

23:35.020 --> 23:40.020
NEXT EPISODE
